think Read REMEMBER's living edge, the 1,024-round itinerary, and the six-season double-seat. Then read the actual bench: the last landed commit is FORA30 (constel durable), and the FORA30 recommend names the socket as the only remaining Constel rung — and the socket is a custody gate (touches seed/comlink + a real wire). Surveyed the frontier: DREY (Mikrophone) done through DREY16, HUNK (image/Photos/parts) done through HUNK93, FORA (Constel Raft) done through FORA30 socket-gated, and mycelium/ (98 modules) whole and witnessed over demo seeds. The pure agent-doable frontier on the OPENED seasons has closed to gates.
think So GATES-ONLY is wrong — the loop should open a fresh season, not declare gates-only or pile a marginal capstone onto a finished ladder (the finishing edge: ship one real thing before naming the next, and the ladders that were open have finished). Lindy-first crux-first over the WHOLE road: which un-started six-season thread holds the clearest agent-doable, no-research, no-gate crux? Season C (Lotus) held zero code, and the Six-Season doc names exactly one bounded task there — the basic audio wire shape for XLR/USB-C/guitar — while pausing only the audio-interface HARDWARE. The wire shape is the software carrier; the hardware is the paused part. Clean to take.
think Drew the waymark by the ladder law before numbering: input season-c-lotus-creative-suite-audio-wire-shape → ALES (index 101, exclude assert GREEN, no collision). Seated ALES in tools/waymark_derive.rish (seated-draws + exclude regex) and .claude/rules/waymark-ladders.md.
think Designed ALES0 lotus/wire.rye on the proven verify-before-trust frame idiom (constel/wire.rye FORA3, mikrophone/wire.rye DREY1): magic LOTS · version · cable · payload_len(bytes) · Sha256 digest · payload(i16 LE PCM). The crux beyond a generic wire — the AUDIO BORDER: deframing is two independent gates, the Sha256 proving the payload whole AND a whole-number-of-i16-samples check refusing PartialSample, so a torn half-sample can never reach a timeline. The cable kind is a ROUTING TAG only — no electrical fact asserted (honest scope; hardware stays paused).
obs GREEN on the first build. Selftest proves: byte-for-byte round-trip on each cable tag; silence and full-scale i16 min/max carry exactly; the audio border refuses PartialSample on an odd payload_len even with a fixed-up digest; a flipped byte refuses DigestMismatch; unknown cable, overlong, truncated, short, and bad-magic each refuse by name; a buffer past max_samples refuses TooManySamples before a byte is written. TAME bans clean; lotus/wire.rye carries ≥2 asserts/fn, u32 in-memory, i16 samples, copy loops not @memcpy, no compound asserts. Purely local — no network, no keys, no funds, no real device; every custody gate untouched.
